Volunteers help us run events like the annual extravaganza, staff the pool (when it's open again) and assist with ad hoc requirements.

If you are interested in becoming a volunteer please sign up. You'll receive regular updates about what has been happening and invites to take part.

You can also read our [volunteer policy](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cEo2f4ofAHhfHUlE2IJzvft1AKN4UB6tgk6IdmNaDJY/edit?usp=sharing) for more detail.

Or email [volunteer@meadowbrookdartington.org](mailto:volunteer@meadowbrookdartington.org) if you have questions before completing the form.
